# Build output and dependencies of the VS Code extension. The repository's
# root .gitignore already carries `node_modules/`; this file is the one a
# reader of editors/ finds, and `out/` has no other home.
#
# `out/` is `tsc`'s output. It is regenerated by `npm run compile` and there
# is nothing that would prove a committed copy of it fresh — docs/PLAN.md:127
# names exactly two generated files in this tree and says a third needs a
# gate. This is not going to be the third.
node_modules/
out/
*.vsix
